# =============================================================================
# SE-Laboratory-Outputs — .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# Covers Python, Java, JavaScript/Node.js, IDE files, OS files, build
# artifacts, coverage, logs, and secrets.
# Legitimate lockfiles are NOT ignored (see bottom of file).
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and environment files — NEVER commit these
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
id_rsa
id_ed25519
id_ecdsa
id_dsa
*.ppk

